   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<h4>客厅是日常居家生活最重要的地点，作为各种活动发生的场所，这里理应是是家中最灵活、最多功能的空间。</h4>\n<h4>这正与宜家新的客厅理念&ldquo;给家更多可能&rdquo;不谋而合。</h4>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-horizontal-line",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "#f5f5f5"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<h4>还有哪里会比2017米兰家具展更适合展览呢？</h4>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/5e/53/5e5346acf87ba6328be175e3cc8cdae5.png"
